.TH SDL_GetPerformanceFrequency 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetPerformanceFrequency \- Get the count per second of the high resolution counter.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_timer.h>
.PP
.BI "Uint64 SDL_GetPerformanceFrequency(void);
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the frequency at which the result from
.BR SDL_GetPerformanceCounter
is adjusted, measured in counts per second\[char46] This value is platform-dependent\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_GetPerformanceCounter (3)
